  "body": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2832#issuecomment-315239343 has some context and a lot of this also got refactored, but I think whenever we create an auxiliary browsing context we're always same-origin at this point due to initial about:blank. So we should remove the same-origin check from step 7 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-a-new-auxiliary-browsing-context (and perhaps assert the origin is the same).\r\n\r\ncc @mystor @domenic ",
